{"result":"ok","response":"collection","data":[{"id":"4141c5dc-c525-4df5-afd7-cc7d192a832f","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Blue Lock"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u30d6\u30eb\u30fc\u30ed\u30c3\u30af"},{"en":"Blue Lock"},{"zh":"\u84dd\u8272\u76d1\u72f1"},{"zh":"\u84dd\u8272\u7981\u533a"},{"zh-hk":"\u85cd\u8272\u76e3\u7344"},{"fr":"Blue Lock"},{"kk":"\u041a\u04e9\u043a \u049b\u0430\u043c\u0430\u043b"},{"pt-br":"Blue Lock"},{"th":"BLUE LOCK \u0e02\u0e31\u0e07\u0e14\u0e27\u0e25\u0e41\u0e02\u0e49\u0e07"},{"tr":"Mavi Kilit"},{"uk":"\u0411\u043b\u0443 \u043b\u043e\u043a"},{"uz":"Ko'k Zindon"},{"bn":"\u09a8\u09c0\u09b2 \u09a8\u09bf\u09b7\u09cd\u09a0"}],"description":{"de":"Nach dem Aus im Achtelfinale bei der WM 2018 ruft der japanische Fu\u00dfballverband ein Projekt ins Leben, das den ultimativen St\u00fcrmer erschaffen und Japan den Weltmeistertitel bringen soll: Blue Lock. Zu diesem Zweck werden die 300 talentiertesten Obersch\u00fcler versammelt, darunter auch Yoichi Isagi, ein unbeschriebenes Blatt. Kann er sich gegen die gro\u00dfe Konkurrenz durchsetzen und Japans gro\u00dfe Hoffnung werden?","en":"After a disastrous defeat at the 2018 World Cup, Japan\u2019s team struggles to regroup. But what\u2019s missing? An absolute Ace Striker, who can guide them to the win. \n\nThe Japan Football Union is hell-bent on creating a striker who hungers for goals and thirsts for victory, and who can be the decisive instrument in turning around a losing match... and to do so, they\u2019ve gathered 300 of Japan\u2019s best and brightest youth players. \n\nWho will emerge to lead the team... and will they be able to out-muscle and out-ego everyone who stands in their way?\n___\n\n**Notes:**\n- **Won the 45th Kodansha Manga Award for Shonen in 2021**\n\n**Links:**\n- Alternative Official English - [K Manga](https:\/\/kmanga.kodansha.com\/title\/10008\/episode\/318774) (U.S. Only)","fr":"Isagi Yoichi a perdu l'opportunit\u00e9 d'aller aux championnats nationaux des lyc\u00e9es parce qu'il a pass\u00e9 la balle \u00e0 son co\u00e9quipier qui a rat\u00e9 son but. Isagi est l'un des 300 attaquants U-18 choisis par Ego Jinpachi, un homme qui a \u00e9t\u00e9 embauch\u00e9 par la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Japonaise de Football apr\u00e8s la Coupe du Monde de la FIFA 2018, pour guider le Japon vers la victoire de la Coupe du Monde en d\u00e9truisant le football japonais. Le plan d'Ego est d'isoler les 300 attaquants dans une institution semblable \u00e0 une prison appel\u00e9e \"Blue Lock\", afin de cr\u00e9er le plus grand \"\u00e9go\u00efste\"\/attaquant du monde, ce qui fait d\u00e9faut dans le football japonais.\n\n---\n\nMaison d'\u00e9dition FR : **Pika**","pl":"Pi\u0142karskie battle royale \u2013 tak mo\u017cna opisa\u0107 ca\u0142\u0105 t\u0119 histori\u0119.  \nZ powodu niepowodze\u0144 na mistrzostwach \u015bwiata, Japo\u0144ski Zwi\u0105zek Pi\u0142ki No\u017cnej postanawia wdro\u017cy\u0107 program, dzi\u0119ki kt\u00f3remu uda si\u0119 stworzy\u0107 rewolucyjnego napastnika.  \nYoichi Isagi otrzymuje zaproszenie do wzi\u0119cia udzia\u0142u w tym w\u0142a\u015bnie programie. Zamkni\u0119ty w plac\u00f3wce o nazwie Blue Lock, b\u0119dzie walczy\u0142 z 299 innymi graczami i stara\u0142 si\u0119 zosta\u0107 najlepszym napastnikiem na \u015bwiecie.","vi":"Blue Lock (\u30d6\u30eb\u30fc\u30ed\u30c3\u30af Bur\u016b Rokku) hay D\u1ef1 \u00e1n b\u1ed3i d\u01b0\u1ee1ng c\u1ea7u th\u1ee7 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t d\u1ef1 \u00e1n chuy\u00ean \u0111\u00e0o t\u1ea1o nh\u1eefng ti\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ea1o tr\u1ebb t\u1eeb kh\u1eafp n\u01a1i tr\u00ean \u0111\u1ea5t n\u01b0\u1edbc Nh\u1eadt B\u1ea3n, bao g\u1ed3m 3 v\u00f2ng tuy\u1ec3n ch\u1ecdn ch\u00ednh v\u00e0 c\u00e1c v\u00f2ng ph\u1ee5. D\u1ef1 \u00e1n n\u00e0y c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 tham gia c\u1ee7a 300 ti\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ea1o tr\u1ebb v\u00e0 h\u1ecd s\u1ebd \u0111\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ea7u tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi nhau trong c\u00e1c v\u00f2ng \u0111\u1ea5u lo\u1ea1i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.","pt-br":"Yoichi Isagi perdeu a oportunidade de ir para o campeonato nacional do ensino m\u00e9dio porque ele passou para seu companheiro de equipe que perdeu em vez de chutar para o gol si mesmo. Isagi \u00e9 um dos 300 atacantes de Sub-18 escolhidos por Jinpachi Ego, contratado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Futebol do Jap\u00e3o ap\u00f3s a Copa do Mundo de 2018, para guiar o Jap\u00e3o na conquista da Copa do Mundo ao destruir o futebol japon\u00eas. O plano de Ego \u00e9 isolar os 300 atacantes em uma institui\u00e7\u00e3o parecida com uma pris\u00e3o chamada \u201cBlue Lock\u201d, para criar o maior \u201cegoista\u201d \/ atacante do mundo, que tem faltado no futebol japon\u00eas."},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"106130","ap":"blue-lock","bl":"60011096","bw":"series\/181367\/list","kt":"53928","mu":"joxc7wz","mal":"114745","raw":"https:\/\/pocket.shonenmagazine.com\/episode\/10834108156632602988","engtl":"https:\/\/kodansha.us\/series\/blue-lock\/"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"ongoing","year":2018,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"07251805-a27e-4d59-b488-f0bfbec15168","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Thriller"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"0a39b5a1-b235-4886-a747-1d05d216532d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Award Winning"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"3b60b75c-a2d7-4860-ab56-05f391bb889c","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Psychological"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"69964a64-2f90-4d33-beeb-f3ed2875eb4c","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Sports"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2019-07-15T20:45:46+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-10-19T22:08:08+00:00","version":78,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["ru","en","vi","es","id","es-la","pt-br","ar","it","tr","uk","fr","cs","hu","de"],"latestUploadedChapter":"b191ac9c-d850-46f6-b03a-9eb4ba37656f"},"relationships":[{"id":"a9a178b7-9c4d-46fb-9543-f50a0faf1403","type":"author"},{"id":"f371a52c-08fb-47b2-b921-9d0d6589cd03","type":"artist"},{"id":"6a941416-dbde-4b7a-b9f7-b314cdecdd32","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"41","fileName":"617e530b-aed4-4825-a05a-75c656429d1f.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-11-14T09:20:13+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-14T09:20:13+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"21169fe3-4d36-4f9e-935e-524cd03ac4df","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"3561c328-fcb3-46d2-b244-7c8ad071aa48","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"39ddc540-a76c-496f-a4b3-95089ea92bcf","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"3ce9d095-ab42-4d7c-ad9e-3c6972de31b9","type":"manga","related":"adapted_from"},{"id":"3d9c2e3c-3709-4f25-ae3a-85c90d3ee0af","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"557a6558-eeb6-4922-a7d0-f16d70bbbab6","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"6ce1d936-12a8-4c50-9f9e-0b239e3c4a85","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"8fef3273-910a-4e80-9c5d-44976d83e6f0","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"911f1591-b577-48da-b0a2-638b82d54114","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"a170b569-34c9-4bbf-8491-90122f6079af","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"b4668276-4b3e-49e0-98e7-fcc6841f7680","type":"manga","related":"spin_off"},{"id":"bc42b9f9-a502-4678-8278-70c2fcebdba5","type":"manga","related":"adapted_from"},{"id":"c8b55f34-21a4-4ca7-8e5d-d58d38fe3203","type":"manga","related":"colored"},{"id":"d4786ab5-d3b1-4d5b-947e-4ee9a7168008","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"e2f88804-6111-45c2-b2b2-24a9e6c18c45","type":"manga","related":"adapted_from"}]},{"id":"6aca5618-378d-42a1-af2e-6f308890ab30","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Kimi ni Koisuru Sanshimai"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u30ad\u30df\u306b\u604b\u3059\u308b\u4e09\u59c9\u59b9"},{"en":"Three Sisters in Love with You"},{"vi":"Ba Ch\u1ecb Em Y\u00eau B\u1ea1n"}],"description":{"en":"In the world of daily full-throttle dedication to his studies, there's Itsuki, a high school boy. The reason he's putting in so much effort into his studies is to reunite with his first love, a girl named Amane, and go on a date with her. While he's immersed in these study-centric days, by a twist of fate, he ends up living together with Amane and her sisters, Shion and Mone...!?","ja":"\u52c9\u5b66\u306b\u65e5\u3005\u5168\u529b\u6295\u7403\u306e\u7537\u5b50\u9ad8\u6821\u751f\u30fb\u6a39\u3002\u52c9\u5f37\u3092\u9811\u5f35\u308b\u7406\u7531\u306f\u3001\u521d\u604b\u306e\u5973\u6027\u30fb\u5929\u97f3\u3068\u518d\u4f1a\u3057\u3001\u30c7\u30fc\u30c8\u3092\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3002\u305d\u3093\u306a\u52c9\u5f37\u4e00\u8272\u306e\u65e5\u3005\u3092\u904e\u3054\u3059\u4e2d\u3001\u5929\u97f3\u3068\u305d\u306e\u59c9\u59b9\u306e\u8a69\u97f3\u30fb\u840c\u97f3\u3068\u3072\u3087\u3093\u306a\u3053\u3068\u304b\u3089\u540c\u5c45\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306b\u306a\u308a\u2026\uff01\uff1f"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"169233","ap":"kimi-ni-koisuru-sanshimai","bl":"1468623","bw":"series\/447665","kt":"73433","mu":"0demntg","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0D8V88X2L","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/806077","mal":"168015","raw":"https:\/\/mangacross.jp\/comics\/kimikoi"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"ongoing","year":2023,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"aafb99c1-7f60-43fa-b75f-fc9502ce29c7","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Harem"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2023-09-12T15:57:09+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-08-18T15:18:49+00:00","version":25,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["en","id","pt-br","es","vi"],"latestUploadedChapter":"e4bfdd15-2478-44b9-a11e-4389e8b025bb"},"relationships":[{"id":"85883f8c-f68c-4453-8d97-a26588052d6f","type":"author"},{"id":"85883f8c-f68c-4453-8d97-a26588052d6f","type":"artist"},{"id":"7450dc3c-46cd-4742-b0f1-da546f8c3dae","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"9","fileName":"439420f7-e04c-4fcb-9d84-f1f690f435dc.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-08-04T13:02:13+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-08-04T13:02:13+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"29676625-f322-41ba-a179-5099d53bb161","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"f7b62193-bdfb-4953-a6c6-0bd1b9a872f9","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Sensou Kyoushitsu"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u6226\u594f\u6559\u5ba4"},{"ja":"The Bugle Call"},{"en":"The Bugle Call: Song of War"},{"en":"Bugle Call Class"},{"ru":"\u0417\u043e\u0432 \u0433\u043e\u0440\u043d\u0430"},{"uk":"\u041f\u043e\u043a\u043b\u0438\u043a \u0441\u0443\u0440\u043c"},{"ar":"\u0646\u062f\u0627\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0648\u0642: \u0644\u062d\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0639\u0631\u0643\u0629"},{"pt-br":"Uma Can\u00e7\u00e3o de Guerra"},{"fr":"The Bugle Call"},{"pt-br":"O Toque de Corneta"}],"description":{"ar":"\u0641\u064a \u0639\u0627\u0645 1294 \u0645\u0646 \u0623\u0631\u0628\u0648\u0631\u0627\u0644\u060c \u064a\u0647\u064a\u0645\u0646 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645 \u062a\u0633\u0639\u0629 \u0623\u0628\u0631\u0627\u062c \u0636\u062e\u0645\u0629 \u062a\u064f\u0639\u0631\u0641 \u0628\u0627\u0633\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0628\u0631\u0627\u062c \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062f\u0628\u0628\u0629\u060c \u0648\u0647\u064a \u0628\u0642\u0627\u064a\u0627 \u062d\u0636\u0627\u0631\u0629 \u0642\u062f\u064a\u0645\u0629. \u0645\u0644\u064a\u0626\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0623\u0633\u0631\u0627\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0641\u0642\u0648\u062f\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0639\u0631\u0641\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0648\u064a\u0629\u060c \u062a\u0643\u0627\u0641\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0645\u0645 \u0644\u0627\u0645\u062a\u0644\u0627\u0643\u0647\u0627. \u0644\u0648\u0643\u0627\u0633 \u0647\u0648 \u0639\u0627\u0632\u0641 \u0628\u0648\u0642 \u0641\u064a \u0639\u0635\u0627\u0628\u0629 \u0645\u0631\u062a\u0632\u0642\u0629 \u0644\u0627 \u064a\u0631\u064a\u062f \u0634\u064a\u0626\u064b\u0627 \u0623\u0643\u062b\u0631 \u0645\u0646 \u062a\u0631\u0643 \u0633\u0627\u062d\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0639\u0631\u0643\u0629 \u0648\u0631\u0627\u0621\u0647 \u0644\u064a\u0635\u0628\u062d \u0645\u0648\u0633\u064a\u0642\u064a\u064b\u0627 \u062d\u0642\u064a\u0642\u064a\u064b\u0627\u060c \u0648\u0645\u0627\u064a\u0633\u062a\u0631\u0648. \u0648\u0644\u0643\u0646 \u0646\u0638\u0631\u064b\u0627 \u0644\u0643\u0648\u0646\u0647 \u0623\u062d\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0634\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u063a\u0627\u0645\u0636\u064a\u0646\u060c \u0648\u0645\u0648\u0647\u0648\u0628\u064b\u0627 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0642\u062f\u0631\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u063a\u0631\u064a\u0628\u0629 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0631\u0624\u064a\u0629 \u0635\u0648\u062a \u0622\u0644\u062a\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0633\u064a\u0642\u064a\u0629\u060c \u064a\u062c\u062f \u0644\u0648\u0643\u0627\u0633 \u0646\u0641\u0633\u0647 \u0645\u0646\u062c\u0630\u0628\u064b\u0627 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0645\u0636\u0636 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u062d\u0631\u0628 \u0630\u0627\u062a \u0623\u0628\u0639\u0627\u062f \u0645\u0644\u062d\u0645\u064a\u0629!\n\n\u0628\u0639\u062f \u062a\u0631\u0643\u0647 \u0644\u064a\u0645\u0648\u062a \u0628\u0639\u062f \u0645\u0639\u0631\u0643\u0629\u060c \u0623\u0646\u0642\u0630 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0644\u0643 \u0627\u0644\u063a\u0627\u0645\u0636 \u0644\u0648\u0643\u0627\u0633 \u0648\u064a\u0639\u0644\u0645 \u0623\u0646\u0647 \u0644\u064a\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u062e\u0635 \u0627\u0644\u0648\u062d\u064a\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0630\u064a \u064a\u062a\u0645\u062a\u0639 \u0628\u0642\u0648\u0649 \u063a\u064a\u0631 \u0639\u0627\u062f\u064a\u0629. \u0634\u0643\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0644\u0643 \u0641\u0631\u064a\u0642\u064b\u0627 \u062e\u0627\u0635\u064b\u0627 \u0645\u0646 \u0623\u0641\u0631\u0627\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0631\u0627\u0645\u0648\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u0630\u064a\u0646 \u064a\u062e\u0637\u0637 \u0644\u0627\u0633\u062a\u062e\u062f\u0627\u0645\u0647\u0645 \u0644\u0645\u0633\u0627\u0639\u062f\u062a\u0647 \u0641\u064a \u0647\u0632\u064a\u0645\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u0645\u0628\u0631\u0627\u0637\u0648\u0631\u064a\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u0627\u0641\u0633\u0629\u060c \u0648\u064a\u0639\u0644\u0645 \u0644\u0648\u0643\u0627\u0633 \u0623\u0646 \u0642\u0648\u0627\u0647\u060c \u0628\u062f\u0644\u0627\u064b \u0645\u0646 \u0623\u0646 \u062a\u0643\u0648\u0646 \u0647\u0631\u0648\u0628\u064b\u0627 \u0645\u0646 \u0633\u0627\u062d\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0639\u0631\u0643\u0629\u060c \u062a\u062c\u0628\u0631\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0622\u0646 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0623\u0646 \u064a\u0643\u0648\u0646 \u0645\u0635\u062f\u0631 \u0625\u0644\u0647\u0627\u0645 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0630\u0627\u0628\u062d.","en":"In Arboral Year 1294, the world is dominated by nine massive towers known as the Spires, remnants of an ancient civilization. Filled with lost secrets and powerful knowledge, nations struggle to possess them. Luca is a bugler in a mercenary company who wants nothing more than to leave the battlefield behind and become a true musician, a maestro. But marked as one of the enigmatic Branch-hexed, and gifted with the strange ability to see the sound of his instrument, Luca finds himself drawn reluctantly into a war of epic proportions!\n\nLeft for dead after a battle, Luca is saved by the mysterious Pontiff and learns he is not the only person with unusual powers. The Pontiff has formed a special team of Branch-hexed individuals he plans to use to help him defeat rival empires, and Luca learns that his powers, rather than being an escape from the battlefield, now force him to be a muse of massacre.\n___\n**Additional Links:**\n- [Official X](https:\/\/x.com\/BugleCall_manga)","fr":"Transcender le fracas des armes, d\u00e9cider du sort de la bataille !\nLuka, orphelin recueilli par le chef d'un groupe de mercenaires, n'est pas comme les autres : une branche pousse sur son cr\u00e2ne et il peut voir les sons, mat\u00e9rialis\u00e9s par des traits de lumi\u00e8re... Le seul \u00e0 lui parler sans crainte est son p\u00e8re adoptif, aussi fin strat\u00e8ge qu'impitoyable au combat. \u00c0 14 ans, Luka a d\u00e9j\u00e0 vu assez d'horreurs pour une vie. En tant que clairon, il est de tous les affrontements, transmettant les ordres via son instrument. En r\u00e9alit\u00e9, il n'a qu'une envie : \u00e9chapper \u00e0 ce quotidien fait de violence pour devenir musicien...\n\n\nSeulement, la bataille qui s'annonce pourrait \u00eatre sa derni\u00e8re : cette fois, il doit prendre les armes... et, surtout, parmi ses opposants se trouvent d'autres \"branchus' dot\u00e9s de divers pouvoirs surnaturels ! Ils font un massacre dans les rangs de Luka, et ce dernier, bless\u00e9, se saisit d'un clairon pour sonner la retraite... C'est alors que son v\u00e9ritable pouvoir se d\u00e9voile : tous ses alli\u00e9s visualisent le son de son instrument et ses indications r\u00e9sonnent comme des ordres dans la t\u00eate des soldats de son camp ! Le gar\u00e7on les sauve gr\u00e2ce aux strat\u00e9gies de son p\u00e8re adoptif.\n\n\nT\u00e9moins de son exploit, les \u00e9nigmatiques adversaires s'emparent de lui. Luka s'\u00e9veille dans une ville entourant une tour immense, vestige des temps anciens et source de magie... Ses nouveaux compagnons sont les protecteurs du lieu, r\u00e9gi par un myst\u00e9rieux pape. Celui-ci passe un accord avec Luka : si le gar\u00e7on met son pouvoir et son don tactique \u00e0 son service, il l'aidera \u00e0 devenir musicien. Sans le savoir, le jeune prodige se retrouve embarqu\u00e9 dans une guerre dont les enjeux le d\u00e9passent !\n\n\nLa lumi\u00e8re du son, seul espoir dans l'horreur des batailles... D'un trait vif et nerveux, une nouvelle g\u00e9n\u00e9ration d'auteurs invente un monde de dark fantasy sans concession. Mais ici, pas de h\u00e9ros surdou\u00e9 au combat, juste un gar\u00e7on r\u00eavant de musique... Et pourtant, de ses talents d\u00e9pend l'issue du conflit !","ja":"\u6a39\u6728\u66a61294\u5e74\u3002\u97f3\u304c\u201c\u898b\u3048\u308b\u201d\u30e9\u30c3\u30d1\u624b\u306e\u5c11\u5e74\u30fb\u30ea\u30e5\u30ab\u306f\u50ad\u5175\u56e3\u306b\u5c5e\u3057\u306a\u304c\u3089\u3082\u6226\u4e89\u3092\u5acc\u3044\u3001\u697d\u5e2b\u306b\u306a\u308b\u4e8b\u3092\u5922\u898b\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3002\u3057\u304b\u3057\u3042\u308b\u65e5\u3001\u300c\u679d\u6191\u304d\u300d\u3068\u547c\u3070\u308c\u308b\u529b\u304c\u767a\u73fe\u3057\u3001\u5f7c\u306e\u904b\u547d\u306f\u5927\u304d\u304f\u52d5\u304d\u51fa\u3059\u2015\u2015\u3002"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"153007","ap":"the-bugle-call-song-of-war","bl":"1189754","bw":"series\/370266\/list","kt":"sensou-kyoushitsu","mu":"82gzjl6","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0BFJBBDPH","cdj":"https:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/product\/NEOBK-2766502","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/718239\/","mal":"147585","raw":"https:\/\/jumpsq.shueisha.co.jp\/rensai\/sensoukyoushitu\/","engtl":"https:\/\/www.viz.com\/shonenjump\/chapters\/the-bugle-call"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":null,"lastChapter":null,"publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"ongoing","year":2022,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"3b60b75c-a2d7-4860-ab56-05f391bb889c","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Psychological"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"ac72833b-c4e9-4878-b9db-6c8a4a99444a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Military"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"cdc58593-87dd-415e-bbc0-2ec27bf404cc","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Fantasy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"ee968100-4191-4968-93d3-f82d72be7e46","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Mystery"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"f42fbf9e-188a-447b-9fdc-f19dc1e4d685","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Music"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"f8f62932-27da-4fe4-8ee1-6779a8c5edba","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Tragedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2022-05-11T14:59:52+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-10-29T13:49:17+00:00","version":90,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["en","ru","vi","es-la","fr","tr","pt-br","ar","uk"],"latestUploadedChapter":"b1e8fe54-dbec-4baa-a226-f861c013caf0"},"relationships":[{"id":"2d3fa977-7dd0-47da-9cae-d4404232fb4c","type":"author"},{"id":"95dc4d7e-45a2-4514-be13-52202f02dc89","type":"artist"},{"id":"8414dab5-e28d-4fcc-8823-117c4d382700","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"14","fileName":"85c12e60-fd34-402b-a62a-f2fc2fde5a28.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-07-02T15:44:44+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-07-02T15:44:44+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"6640d5cb-18a0-4264-8c0a-9dcbe39be5ef","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"792e28fb-27be-425d-b92a-64e2d5474657","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"en":"Akane-banashi"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u3042\u304b\u306d\u567a"},{"fr":"Le rakugo d'Akane"},{"ne":"\u0906\u0915\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u094b \u0915\u0925\u093e"},{"pt-br":"Akane-Banashi"},{"ru":"\u0421\u043a\u0430\u0437\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043e\u0431 \u0410\u043a\u0430\u043d\u044d"},{"es-la":"El relato de Akane"},{"th":"Akane-banashi"}],"description":{"en":"Rakugo--the ultimate form of storytelling, where everything in a story is expressed with just your body and words. Shinta and his daughter Akane have been seduced by this wonderful form of classical Japanese entertainment. Having observed her father strive to pass the shin'uchi rakugo test, Akane takes her own steps into this unique world!","fr":"Shinta s'est perfectionn\u00e9 13 ans durant afin d'atteindre le statut de Shin'uchi, le plus haut rang des rakugo-ka. Mais malgr\u00e9 sa tr\u00e8s bonne performance lors de l'examen de passage, le juge de l'\u00e9preuve, l'\u00e9m\u00e9rite Ma\u00eetre Arakawa Issho, a d\u00e9cid\u00e9 de renvoyer de l'\u00e9cole Arakawa l'ensemble des participants sans donner davantage d'explication ! Ainsi s'arr\u00eata nette la carri\u00e8re de Shinta, qui avait tant sacrifi\u00e9 pour accomplir son r\u00eave\u2026\nMais Akane, la fille de Shinta qui admirait son p\u00e8re et son rakugo plus que tout, ne compte pas en rester l\u00e0 !","ja":"\u5e7c\u3044\u9803\u3001\u7236\u306e\u9b54\u6cd5\u306e\u69d8\u306a\u843d\u8a9e\u306b\u9b45\u305b\u3089\u308c\u305f\u6731\u97f3\u306f\u3001\u7236\u306e\u3042\u308b\u4e00\u5e2d\u3092\u6a5f\u306b\u81ea\u8eab\u3082\u567a\u5bb6\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306e\u9053\u3092\u6b69\u307f\u59cb\u3081\u308b\u300217\u6b73\u306b\u306a\u3063\u305f\u6731\u97f3\u304c\u76ee\u6307\u3059\u306e\u306f\u843d\u8a9e\u754c\u306e\u6700\u9ad8\u4f4d\u300c\u771f\u6253\u300d\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3053\u3068\u2015\u2015\u3002\u4e00\u6d41\u306e\u6280\u91cf\u3092\u7fd2\u5f97\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u3001\u69d8\u3005\u306a\u8a66\u7df4\u304c\u6731\u97f3\u3092\u5f85\u3061\u53d7\u3051\u2026\uff01\uff1f","th":"\u0e17\u0e35\u0e48\u0e2a\u0e38\u0e14\u0e41\u0e2b\u0e48\u0e07\u0e28\u0e34\u0e25\u0e1b\u0e30\u0e01\u0e32\u0e23\u0e40\u0e25\u0e48\u0e32\u0e40\u0e23\u0e37\u0e48\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e17\u0e35\u0e48\u0e43\u0e0a\u0e49\u0e1c\u0e39\u0e49\u0e41\u0e2a\u0e14\u0e07\u0e40\u0e1e\u0e35\u0e22\u0e07\u0e2b\u0e19\u0e36\u0e48\u0e07\u0e04\u0e19\u0e41\u0e25\u0e30\u0e40\u0e23\u0e37\u0e48\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e40\u0e25\u0e48\u0e32\u0e40\u0e1e\u0e35\u0e22\u0e07\u0e2b\u0e19\u0e36\u0e48\u0e07\u0e40\u0e23\u0e37\u0e48\u0e2d\u0e07 --- \"\u0e23\u0e32\u0e04\u0e38\u0e42\u0e01\u0e30\" \u0e19\u0e31\u0e01\u0e23\u0e32\u0e04\u0e38\u0e42\u0e01\u0e30 \u0e2d\u0e32\u0e23\u0e32\u0e04\u0e32\u0e27\u0e30 \u0e0a\u0e34\u0e19\u0e15\u0e30\u0e41\u0e25\u0e30\u0e2d\u0e32\u0e04\u0e32\u0e40\u0e19\u0e30\u0e25\u0e39\u0e01\u0e2a\u0e32\u0e27\u0e02\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e40\u0e02\u0e32\u0e15\u0e48\u0e32\u0e07\u0e01\u0e47\u0e2b\u0e25\u0e07\u0e40\u0e2a\u0e19\u0e48\u0e2b\u0e4c\u0e02\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e04\u0e27\u0e32\u0e21\u0e1a\u0e31\u0e19\u0e40\u0e17\u0e34\u0e07\u0e2d\u0e31\u0e19\u0e2a\u0e38\u0e14\u0e41\u0e2a\u0e19\u0e08\u0e30\u0e40\u0e23\u0e35\u0e22\u0e1a\u0e07\u0e48\u0e32\u0e22\u0e19\u0e35\u0e49 \u0e43\u0e19\u0e27\u0e31\u0e19\u0e17\u0e35\u0e48\u0e0a\u0e34\u0e19\u0e15\u0e30\u0e02\u0e36\u0e49\u0e19\u0e40\u0e27\u0e17\u0e35\u0e41\u0e2a\u0e14\u0e07\u0e43\u0e19\u0e01\u0e32\u0e23\u0e2a\u0e2d\u0e1a\u0e40\u0e25\u0e37\u0e48\u0e2d\u0e19\u0e0a\u0e31\u0e49\u0e19\u0e40\u0e1b\u0e47\u0e19\u0e0a\u0e34\u0e19\u0e2d\u0e38\u0e08\u0e34 \u0e2d\u0e32\u0e04\u0e32\u0e40\u0e19\u0e30\u0e40\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e01\u0e47\u0e44\u0e14\u0e49\u0e0a\u0e21\u0e01\u0e32\u0e23\u0e41\u0e2a\u0e14\u0e07\u0e19\u0e31\u0e49\u0e19\u0e2d\u0e22\u0e39\u0e48\u0e41\u0e25\u0e30\u0e40\u0e2a\u0e49\u0e19\u0e17\u0e32\u0e07\u0e02\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e19\u0e31\u0e01\u0e23\u0e32\u0e04\u0e38\u0e42\u0e01\u0e30\u0e17\u0e35\u0e48\u0e2d\u0e32\u0e04\u0e32\u0e40\u0e19\u0e30\u0e15\u0e31\u0e14\u0e2a\u0e34\u0e19\u0e43\u0e08\u0e01\u0e49\u0e32\u0e27\u0e40\u0e14\u0e34\u0e19\u0e44\u0e1b\u0e01\u0e47\u0e04\u0e37\u0e2d---- \u0e21\u0e31\u0e07\u0e07\u0e30\u0e23\u0e32\u0e04\u0e38\u0e42\u0e01\u0e30\u0e02\u0e19\u0e32\u0e19\u0e41\u0e17\u0e49\u0e17\u0e35\u0e48\u0e40\u0e2b\u0e25\u0e48\u0e32\u0e19\u0e31\u0e01\u0e23\u0e32\u0e04\u0e38\u0e42\u0e01\u0e30\u0e25\u0e49\u0e27\u0e19\u0e21\u0e32\u0e1b\u0e23\u0e30\u0e0a\u0e31\u0e19\u0e1d\u0e35\u0e21\u0e37\u0e2d\u0e1f\u0e32\u0e14\u0e1f\u0e31\u0e19\u0e01\u0e31\u0e19\u0e44\u0e14\u0e49\u0e40\u0e1b\u0e34\u0e14\u0e09\u0e32\u0e01\u0e02\u0e36\u0e49\u0e19\u0e41\u0e25\u0e49\u0e27!\n\n(Source: MangaPlus)","pt-br":"Rakugo - a forma perfeita de contar hist\u00f3rias, na qual tudo \u00e9 expresso apenas com seu corpo e palavras. \nShinta e sua filha, Akane, foram seduzidos por essa maravilhosa forma cl\u00e1ssica de entretenimento. \nObservando seu pai treinar para passar no teste de Shin\u2019uchi, Akane avan\u00e7a neste mundo \u00fanico."},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"144866","ap":"akane-banashi","bl":"1133116","bw":"series\/355453\/list","kt":"62491","mu":"u95xjcy","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/-\/en\/dp\/B0B55WVKWZ","cdj":"https:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/product\/NEOBK-3145685","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/702834\/","mal":"144034","raw":"https:\/\/shonenjumpplus.com\/episode\/316190246999430065","engtl":"https:\/\/mangaplus.shueisha.co.jp\/titles\/100185"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"ongoing","year":2022,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"0a39b5a1-b235-4886-a747-1d05d216532d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Award Winning"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group"