to accept the position or not, Kaede discovers another alien hidden in plain sight\u2014one with a tragic story to share.","fr":"Une enqu\u00eatrice d'assurance intergalactique se rend chez les aliens qui remboursent pas leurs pr\u00eats pour leur latter la gueule, et au cours d''une enqu\u00eate, elle tombe sur un lyc\u00e9en qui peut d\u00e9celer le mensonge chez les autres.","ja":"\u4eba\u306e\u5618\u304c\u898b\u629c\u3051\u308b\u9ad8\u6821\u751f\u30fb\u6c34\u68ee \u6953\u306f\u30c9\u30e9\u30a4\u306b\u751f\u304d\u3066\u304d\u305f\u2026 \u8b0e\u306e\u5973\u5b50\u9ad8\u751f\u30fb\u7a42\u6751 \u71d0\u306b\u51fa\u4f1a\u3046\u307e\u3067\u306f\u3002\u5931\u8e2a\u3057\u305f\u6c34\u68ee\u306e\u53cb\u4eba\u30fb\u76f8\u6fa4\u3092\u5730\u7403\u5916\u751f\u547d\u4f53\u3068\u8a00\u3044\u653e\u3064\u7a42\u6751\u3002\u5f7c\u5973\u304c\u8a9e\u308b\u2026\u5b87\u5b99\u4eba\u5c02\u9580\u306e\u4fdd\u967a\u4f1a\u793e\u300cCOSMOS\u300d\u3068\u306f\u2015\u2015\u2015\uff01\uff1f"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"162799","ap":"cosmos-ryuuhei-tamura","bl":"20070238","bw":"series\/445090\/list","kt":"70482","mu":"ch0f9zv","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0CLKW1BDB","cdj":"https:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/product\/NEOBK-2909742","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/798431","mal":"158889","raw":"https:\/\/www.sunday-webry.com\/episode\/4856001361087694972","engtl":"https:\/\/www.viz.com\/vizmanga\/chapters\/cosmos"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"seinen","status":"ongoing","year":2023,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"256c8bd9-4904-4360-bf4f-508a76d67183","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Sci-Fi"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"nam